; A total cost is the per-unit price total / |quantity|, so it keeps its own
; sign and takes the quantity's on top of it. All four combinations balance.
2026-01-01 positive quantity, positive total
    assets:eur      100 EUR @@ 110 USD
    assets:usd     -110 USD

2026-01-02 negative quantity, positive total
    assets:eur2    -100 EUR @@ 110 USD
    assets:usd2     110 USD

2026-01-03 positive quantity, negative total
    assets:eur3     100 EUR @@ -110 USD
    assets:usd3     110 USD

2026-01-04 negative quantity, negative total
    assets:eur4    -100 EUR @@ -110 USD
    assets:usd4    -110 USD
